# OFAM freeze: DOOM (#Z C:\DOOM\DOOM.NAP). Screendumps while it runs (title/demo), then
# Esc (menu), Up (wraps to Quit Game), Return, Y -> DOOM exits, desktop back.
# (first attempt F10 + Y did not raise the quit prompt: checks/doom-first-attempt/)
# Ticks hz_200 after the injector arms.
100 parkbr
2000 mark D00_START
4000 mark D01_RUNNING
6000 mark D02_RUNNING2
8000 key 01
8006 key 81
8800 mark D03_MENU
9000 key 48
9006 key C8
9400 mark D03B_QUIT_SELECTED
9600 key 1C
9606 key 9C
10400 mark D04_QUITPROMPT
10600 key 15
10606 key 95
12600 mark D05_AFTER_QUIT
13000 mark END
